 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Amazon Chime SDK Media Pipelines API (2021-07-15). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Media insights pipeline configurations are stored records: no media is captured, concatenated, transcribed or analyzed, no pipeline runs, and no Kinesis Video Stream pool exists. Media pipelines of every kind, Kinesis Video Stream pools, speaker search and voice tone analysis tasks return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. The elements (processors and sinks), the alert configuration and the access role ARN are stored without being evaluated or resolved. A configuration is identified by its unique name, its generated ID or its ARN (media-insights-pipeline-configuration/name, as inferred). The tag operations are not bound here: all Amazon Chime SDK models share the same tag routes and the engine serves them from the voice model only, so CreateMediaInsightsPipelineConfiguration refuses Tags. At most 25 configurations per Region exist as a simulator limit.",
  "title": "Amazon Chime SDK Media Pipelines (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2021-07-15"
 },
